os_log and the thread identifier.

The log stream needs os_log, which is 2016: the option to log through it
is simply absent here, and the data log goes where it goes on every other
system. A thread identifier comes from its mach port instead of
pthread_threadid_np, which is 10.6 - and the port is already the 32 bits
this wants.

